---
title: "Aggro's Trophy House"
layout: layouts/ffBase.njk
permalink: /shrines/finalfantasyxiv/housing/
description: "Aggro Phobic's FFXIV trophy house — a personal museum of rare furnishings, in-game achievements, aquariums and screenshots."
customcss: "/assets/css/ffxiv/housing.css"
---
{% set m = ffxivHousingMuseum %}
{% set h = ffxivHousing %}

<div class="ff-museum" data-housing-museum>
  <section class="ff-card ff-museum-hero" aria-labelledby="museum-title">
    <div class="ff-museum-hero__copy">
      <p class="ff-museum-kicker">✦ Aggro's little corner of Eorzea ✦</p>
      <h1 id="museum-title">The Trophy House <span>♡</span></h1>
      <p class="ff-museum-hero__intro">{{ m.subtitle }}</p>
      <p class="ff-museum-hero__detail">Not every treasure is expensive. Some just took a ridiculous amount of effort to earn — and those are the ones that deserve a home.</p>
      <div class="ff-museum-hero__links">
        <a class="ff-button ff-button--primary" href="#cabinet">✦ Trophy cabinet</a>
        <a class="ff-button" href="#house-photos">♡ House scrapbook</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ff-museum-handwritten">trophies, treasures & a suspicious number of flowers ♡</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ff-museum-hero__visual">
      {% if h.home.image %}<img src="{{ h.home.image | escape }}" alt="{{ h.home.alt | escape }}" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">{% endif %}
      <div class="ff-museum-photo-stamp"><span>⌂ a home for adventures</span><strong>since the very beginning ♡</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="ff-museum-jumps ff-card" aria-label="Around the trophy house">
    <a href="#cabinet"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span> The cabinet</a>
    <a href="#wings"><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span> Museum wings</a>
    <a href="#aquariums"><span aria-hidden="true">🐟</span> Aquariums</a>
    <a href="#house-photos"><span aria-hidden="true">♡</span> Scrapbook</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="ff-card ff-museum-section" id="cabinet" aria-labelledby="cabinet-title">
    <div class="ff-museum-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="ff-museum-kicker">✧ a little proof of adventure</p>
        <h2 id="cabinet-title">The trophy cabinet</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Real trophies, real screenshots, and the story behind each one.</p>
    </div>

    {% if m.photographed.length %}
      <div class="ff-museum-toolbar">
        <label class="ff-museum-search-label">Find an exhibit
          <input type="search" data-museum-search placeholder="Name, source, expansion…" autocomplete="off">
        </label>
        <label class="ff-museum-select-label">Room
          <select data-museum-room>
            <option value="all">Every room</option>
            {% for wing in m.wings %}<option value="{{ wing.id | escape }}">{{ wing.title | escape }}</option>{% endfor %}
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="ff-museum-match-count" data-museum-count aria-live="polite">{{ m.photographed.length }} photographed treasure{% if m.photographed.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="ff-museum-exhibit-grid">
        {% for item in m.photographed %}
        <article class="ff-museum-exhibit" data-museum-exhibit data-room="{{ item.wing | escape }}" data-search="{{ (item.name + ' ' + item.source + ' ' + item.expansion + ' ' + item.note) | lower | escape }}">
          <button type="button" class="ff-museum-exhibit__photo" data-museum-photo
                  data-photo-title="{{ item.name | escape }}" data-photo-note="{{ item.note | escape }}"
                  data-photo-main="{{ item.image | escape }}" data-photo-images="{{ item.photos | dump | escape }}"
                  aria-label="Enlarge photographs of {{ item.name | escape }}">
            <img src="{{ item.image | escape }}" alt="{{ item.name | escape }}, photographed in Aggro's house" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="ff-museum-photo-hint">⌕ view photos</span>
          </button>
          <div class="ff-museum-exhibit__copy">
            <small>✦ {{ item.expansion | escape }} · {{ item.wing | escape }}</small>
            <h3>{{ item.name | escape }}</h3>
            <p>{{ item.note | escape }}</p>
            {% if item.source %}<span class="ff-museum-acquired">Earned through · {{ item.source | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if item.obtained %}<span class="ff-museum-obtained">Collected {{ item.obtained | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="ff-museum-no-match" data-museum-empty hidden>Nothing on this shelf matches those filters ♡</p>
    {% else %}
      <div class="ff-museum-intro-panel">
        <div class="ff-museum-intro-panel__symbol" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
        <div>
          <h3>A museum with a story in the making</h3>
          <p>The house already has a history. The cabinet is reserved for trophies Aggro has personally earned and photographed; the plans below show what kind of collection is taking shape.</p>
          <a href="#house-photos">Come see the house instead ♡ →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="ff-museum-wings" id="wings" aria-labelledby="wings-title">
    <div class="ff-museum-heading ff-museum-heading--outside">
      <div><p class="ff-museum-kicker">⌂ four little corners of the museum</p><h2 id="wings-title">A place for everything</h2></div>
      <p>The room plan is a wish, not an inventory of already-placed furnishings.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ff-museum-wing-grid">
      {% for wing in m.wings %}
        <article class="ff-card ff-museum-wing">
          <span class="ff-museum-wing__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ wing.icon }}</span>
          <p class="ff-museum-kicker">{{ wing.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
          <h3>{{ wing.title | escape }}</h3>
          <p>{{ wing.text | escape }}</p>
          <small>{{ wing.details | escape }}</small>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-card ff-museum-section ff-museum-dreams" aria-labelledby="dreams-title">
    <div class="ff-museum-heading">
      <div><p class="ff-museum-kicker">✦ trophies worth chasing</p><h2 id="dreams-title">On the museum's wish list</h2></div>
      <p>Some of the pieces planned for the house — not yet presented as owned.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ff-museum-wish-grid">
      {% for item in m.hunted %}
        <article class="ff-museum-wish">
          <span class="ff-museum-wish__star" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
          <div>
            <small>{{ item.expansion | escape }}</small>
            <h3>{{ item.name | escape }}</h3>
            <p>{{ item.source | escape }}</p>
          </div>
          <span class="ff-museum-wish__tag">planned</span>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="ff-museum-tiny-note">♡ The full acquisition checklist lives in the personal tracker; this page is for the home and its stories.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-card ff-museum-section ff-museum-aquarium" id="aquariums" aria-labelledby="aquarium-title">
    <div class="ff-museum-heading">
      <div><p class="ff-museum-kicker">🐟 a gallery beneath the waves</p><h2 id="aquarium-title">Six little worlds of water</h2></div>
      <p>One signature fish from each expansion is the goal, plus room for a few additional tanks.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ff-museum-fish-list">
      {% for fish in m.aquariums %}
        <div class="ff-museum-fish-slot"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span><small>{{ fish.short | escape }}</small><strong>{{ fish.expansion | escape }}</strong></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="ff-museum-fish-footer"><p>These are display ideas, not claims about which fish are already in tanks. Actual catch progress stays with FroggyFish.</p><a class="ff-button" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/fishing/">Visit FroggyFish ↗</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-card ff-museum-section ff-museum-scrapbook" id="house-photos" aria-labelledby="photos-title">
    <div class="ff-museum-heading">
      <div><p class="ff-museum-kicker">♡ the house before the exhibits</p><h2 id="photos-title">A little house scrapbook</h2></div>
      <p>The mushroom garden, glowing trees, and lovely odd corners that started the whole thing.</p>
    </div>
    {% if h.favouriteCorner.image %}
    <div class="ff-museum-feature-photo">
      <button type="button" data-museum-photo data-photo-title="{{ h.favouriteCorner.title | escape }}" data-photo-main="{{ h.favouriteCorner.image | escape }}" data-photo-note="{{ h.favouriteCorner.caption | escape }}" aria-label="Enlarge {{ h.favouriteCorner.title | escape }} photo">
        <img src="{{ h.favouriteCorner.image | escape }}" alt="{{ h.favouriteCorner.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </button>
      <div><span class="ff-museum-kicker">✦ favourite corner</span><h3>{{ h.favouriteCorner.title | escape }}</h3><p>{{ h.favouriteCorner.caption | escape }}</p><span class="ff-museum-handwritten">never enough giant mushrooms ♡</span></div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="ff-museum-photo-grid">
      {% for photo in h.rooms %}
        {% if photo.image %}
          <figure class="ff-museum-scrap-photo">
            <button type="button" data-museum-photo data-photo-title="{{ photo.title | escape }}" data-photo-main="{{ photo.image | escape }}" data-photo-note="{{ photo.caption | escape }}" aria-label="Enlarge {{ photo.title | escape }} photo">
              <img src="{{ photo.image | escape }}" alt="{{ photo.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </button>
            <figcaption><strong>{{ photo.title | escape }}</strong><span>{{ photo.caption | escape }}</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-card ff-museum-outro">
    <div><p class="ff-museum-kicker">✦ more stories from Aggro</p><h2>It's not just furniture.</h2><p>There's the effort behind it, the people there for it, and the screenshot you take when it finally comes home.</p></div>
    <div class="ff-museum-outro__links"><a class="ff-button ff-button--primary" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/achievements/">Achievement journal →</a><a class="ff-button" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/collections/">Aggro's hoard →</a></div>
  </section>
</div>

<dialog class="ff-museum-lightbox" data-museum-dialog aria-labelledby="museum-dialog-title">
  <div class="ff-museum-lightbox__inner">
    <div class="ff-museum-lightbox__top"><div><p class="ff-museum-kicker">✧ from Aggro's scrapbook</p><h2 id="museum-dialog-title" data-museum-dialog-title></h2></div><button type="button" class="ff-museum-lightbox__close" data-museum-dialog-close aria-label="Close photograph">×</button></div>
    <div class="ff-museum-lightbox__image-wrap"><img data-museum-dialog-image alt=""><button type="button" data-museum-prev aria-label="Previous photo">‹</button><button type="button" data-museum-next aria-label="Next photo">›</button></div>
    <div class="ff-museum-lightbox__bottom"><p data-museum-dialog-note></p><span data-museum-dialog-counter></span></div>
  </div>
</dialog>
<script src="/assets/js/shrines/ffxiv/housing-museum.js" defer></script>
